# Data fixtures are parsed byte-for-byte by DFDL/Kaitai/DRB descriptions, so
# they must never get line-ending conversion (core.autocrlf would otherwise
# turn a CSV fixture's LF into CRLF on Windows checkouts and change the data).
*.csv  -text
*.bin  binary
*.fits binary

# The in-project Maven repository is served byte-for-byte: its .sha1 files are
# checksums of the exact bytes, so no line-ending conversion of the .pom (or
# anything else) on checkout.
third-party/maven-repo/** binary
